      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Renders Template-kun performing a motion, in eight directions.\n\nLoad Motion: 'sprute/...' are the bundled motions. Any animated GLB placed in ComfyUI's input folder is listed too, and gets retargeted onto Template-kun. For a GLB with several animations, type the animation's name, e.g. run.\n\nIn the animate workflow, Render Driving Video replaces the driving video's Load Image: connect its IMAGE and MASK where that node's outputs went.\n\nSave Driving Video embeds timing in the WebP itself. Its loop_frames, loop and fps inputs come from Render Driving Video, so frame rate and cycle length stay synchronized. No separate JSON export is needed. Final loop cutting and every-Nth selection run in the animate workflow Save Animation node.\n\nFrames=0 renders the complete source clip: one cycle for declared loops. The CLI repeats it to 4n+1 frames for SCAIL2; non-loop clips hold their final pose instead."
      ]
    }
